| AC-5.2 | `difficulty` always within `ZoneOfProximalDevelopment` |
| AC-5.3 | `scaffolding = "high"` when open misconceptions ≥ 2 |
| AC-5.4 | 100 random learner-state fixtures produce sensible strategies |

