### 10.3 Acceptance criteria

| ID | Criterion |
|---|---|
| AC-7.1 | Frozen benchmark has ≥ 50 scenarios; `isFrozen = true` |
| AC-7.2 | Optimizer cannot write to the benchmark (DB-level constraint or separate table) |
